    {
      "id": "-4RAEhkesTYlutrN3krxr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2073.337989636604,
      "y": -1237.3509013701782,
      "width": 276.77984619140625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1610364132,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 747603812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751786554997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\n\n- Follow and follower\n- post -> image, video, text \n- news feed. \n- instagram story / status\n- like,comments,share.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\n\n- Follow and follower\n- post -> image, video, text \n- news feed. \n- instagram story / status\n- like,comments,share.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xtypx_Ghia9zDBryqKZwS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2068.6068622194734,
      "y": -1026.9423008728681,
      "width": 555.2796630859375,
      "height": 1500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2010132956,
      "version": 2726,
      "versionNonce": 1185099228,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751808209308,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional requirements: \n- highly available. \n- scalable.\n- alerts and montoring\n- eventual consistency in post, like etc. \n- save storage with image and all.\n\nEstimations: \n- 9B people on world.  \n- 2B total user account\n- 100M MAU\n    - ~4M daily \n    - ~1000 per second active user. \n    - but in peak -> 10x -> 10k user active per second.\n    - qps for post 2 post per day ->  20k qps.\n    - follow/unfollow -> 10k qps. \n    - read feed -> 5 time scroll -> 50k qps. \n- Storage -> later \n\n\nEntity: \n- users, relation, postmeta, story, status, like, comment. \n\n\nApi design: \n\nx-token -> userid and all authorisation.\n\n1. follow user, unfollow users\n\n      -  /api/v1/relation/follow?id=<>\n      -  /api/v1/relation/unfollow?id=<>  GET\n\n2. Post \n\n/api/v1/post       POST\nRequest: { description, picUrl, location ....}\nResponse: { Success }\n\n3. Feed \n\n/api/v1/feed/       paginated POST\n\nRequest: { pageSize, cursor }\nResponse: { pagSize, cursor, posts : [{...}] }\n\n4. Apis for comment, like \n\n/api/v1/post/like?id=<>        PUT\n/api/v1/post/comment?id=<>   PUT\n\n5. Story -> short video.\n\n/api/v1/story             POST\nRequest: { storyUrl: <> }\nResponse: <>\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional requirements: \n- highly available. \n- scalable.\n- alerts and montoring\n- eventual consistency in post, like etc. \n- save storage with image and all.\n\nEstimations: \n- 9B people on world.  \n- 2B total user account\n- 100M MAU\n    - ~4M daily \n    - ~1000 per second active user. \n    - but in peak -> 10x -> 10k user active per second.\n    - qps for post 2 post per day ->  20k qps.\n    - follow/unfollow -> 10k qps. \n    - read feed -> 5 time scroll -> 50k qps. \n- Storage -> later \n\n\nEntity: \n- users, relation, postmeta, story, status, like, comment. \n\n\nApi design: \n\nx-token -> userid and all authorisation.\n\n1. follow user, unfollow users\n\n      -  /api/v1/relation/follow?id=<>\n      -  /api/v1/relation/unfollow?id=<>  GET\n\n2. Post \n\n/api/v1/post       POST\nRequest: { description, picUrl, location ....}\nResponse: { Success }\n\n3. Feed \n\n/api/v1/feed/       paginated POST\n\nRequest: { pageSize, cursor }\nResponse: { pagSize, cursor, posts : [{...}] }\n\n4. Apis for comment, like \n\n/api/v1/post/like?id=<>        PUT\n/api/v1/post/comment?id=<>   PUT\n\n5. Story -> short video.\n\n/api/v1/story             POST\nRequest: { storyUrl: <> }\nResponse: <>\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
