      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751803022381,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "access pattern\n- add new post \n- update post ( very less )\n- delete post\n- high write, need post by id \n  or by userId, simple query.\n- again cassandra or dynamo\n  can be used.\n\nuserId as partition\npostId as sort key\n\nnodes -> 10nodes\n\npostId, userId, ... ",
      "fontSize": 5.380705055847051,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "access pattern\n- add new post \n- update post ( very less )\n- delete post\n- high write, need post by id \n  or by userId, simple query.\n- again cassandra or dynamo\n  can be used.\n\nuserId as partition\npostId as sort key\n\nnodes -> 10nodes\n\npostId, userId, ... ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
