      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "find recent posts for that friend\nlet say on avg we have 500 friends\nthat will lead to \n50k * 500, 25M/s\n\nwe can do trade off with eventuall\nconsistency and do this offline\n\nusing pattern CQRS, separate read and \nwrite.\n\n",
