    {
      "id": "ca_zc49WVBd2GqgNK48M4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1479.892581807889,
      "y": -226.00492404608167,
      "width": 594.2996826171875,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b99",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 811754844,
      "version": 114,
      "versionNonce": 1757237084,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751808512273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Database Schema:\n\nUser\n-id , name, email, bio, createdTime.... \n\nPostmeta\n- id, auth_id, locatoin, description, postUrls, creationTime\n\nPostLike\n- postid, likecounts. // update asyc\n\nPostComments: \n- postID, commentId, text: <>, createdTime, auth_id\n\nStoryMeta: \n- storyId, storyURl: <> , creationTime , expireTime, auth_id \n\nblobstorage: for image, video storage. \n\n \nDatabase type ? -> at time of high level design.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Database Schema:\n\nUser\n-id , name, email, bio, createdTime.... \n\nPostmeta\n- id, auth_id, locatoin, description, postUrls, creationTime\n\nPostLike\n- postid, likecounts. // update asyc\n\nPostComments: \n- postID, commentId, text: <>, createdTime, auth_id\n\nStoryMeta: \n- storyId, storyURl: <> , creationTime , expireTime, auth_id \n\nblobstorage: for image, video storage. \n\n \nDatabase type ? -> at time of high level design.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qLkZG46mMj9KI5rdtc_eB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -727.25474308915,
      "y": -339.49224074325366,
      "width": 609.01953125,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 857522524,
      "version": 934,
      "versionNonce": 1167880924,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751809724203,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow\n- follow/unfollow\n- user follow goes to db and add new pair or delete new pair\n\nPost: \n- upload photo s3, get url\n- prepare request , send to post backend service. \n- update the metadata.\n- at backend if famous person person the cache as well. \n- emit event. \n- come to worker\n- it check whwether faous person or not.\n- if not, it will fetch user's friend and populate their db. \n- if key already exist in cache, cache worker will update it\n  else ignore.\n\nNewsFeed: \n- call news feed service\n- check score of user, if less than threshold\n- fetch at run time by fetch friends and posts upto 2 pages .\n- cache these 2 pages and return 1 page. ( can do aysnc ) \n- > threshold , check in cache and return\n- if not fetch from db and put in cache and return. \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow\n- follow/unfollow\n- user follow goes to db and add new pair or delete new pair\n\nPost: \n- upload photo s3, get url\n- prepare request , send to post backend service. \n- update the metadata.\n- at backend if famous person person the cache as well. \n- emit event. \n- come to worker\n- it check whwether faous person or not.\n- if not, it will fetch user's friend and populate their db. \n- if key already exist in cache, cache worker will update it\n  else ignore.\n\nNewsFeed: \n- call news feed service\n- check score of user, if less than threshold\n- fetch at run time by fetch friends and posts upto 2 pages .\n- cache these 2 pages and return 1 page. ( can do aysnc ) \n- > threshold , check in cache and return\n- if not fetch from db and put in cache and return. \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
